RA], 15 U.S.C. 1681-1681u, that apply to consumer reporting agencies. <br><=
br>- Resellers regularly assemble consumer credit information and sell the =
information to third parties in the form of consumer reports. They therefor=
e fall within the FCRA's definition of "consumer reporting agency." Section=
 1681a[f]. <br><br>- Resellers must comply with the full panoply of FCRA pr=
